sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant API as index.js
    participant OCR as Tesseract.js
    participant NRM as normalizer.js
    participant KB as medical_ranges.json
    participant AUD as audit.js
    participant LLM1 as LLM Explainer
    participant LLM2 as LLM Judge
    participant PRS as responseParser.js

    User->>API: POST /process-report

    alt Image uploaded
        API->>OCR: Recognize image text
        OCR-->>API: Raw text + confidence score
        API->>API: Delete temp file
    else Text sent
        API->>API: Use body text, confidence = 1.0
    end

    Note over API: Split text into individual test lines

    loop For each test line
        API->>NRM: normalizeTest(line)
        NRM->>NRM: Read number, unit, report range
        NRM->>NRM: Clean test name
        NRM->>KB: Fuzzy search cleaned name in medical_ranges.json
        KB-->>NRM: Best match entry + similarity score
        NRM->>NRM: Convert value and report range to KB unit via units.js
        NRM->>NRM: Compare report range vs KB range
        alt Ranges differ by more than 0.01
            NRM->>AUD: logForReview — Tag is Mismatch
            AUD->>AUD: Check for duplicate entry
            AUD-->>NRM: Written to review_queue.json
        else Ranges match or no report range
            NRM->>NRM: Tag as Report Range Used or KB Range Used
        end
        NRM->>NRM: Assign Low / Normal / High status
        NRM-->>API: Structured test object
    end

    Note over LLM1: LLM Call 1 — Explanation
    API->>LLM1: Normalized test context string
    LLM1-->>API: Summary + explanation per test

    Note over LLM2: LLM Call 2 — Verification
    API->>LLM2: Context + Call 1 output
    LLM2-->>API: TRUE or FALSE

    alt FALSE
        API-->>User: Hallucination detected — unprocessed
    else TRUE
        API->>PRS: Format final response
        PRS->>PRS: Calc confidence score
        PRS-->>API: Final JSON
        API-->>User: Tests, summary, explanations, confidence
    end
